sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Contact Center / SDK
    participant API as Ingestion API
    participant S3 as S3
    participant EB as EventBridge / SNS
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant K as Kafka
    participant V as Upload Validator
    participant W as ASR / Enrich / Index
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant ES as Elasticsearch
    participant R as Redis

    Note over Client,R: Happy path — S3 completion triggers pipeline (no client POST /complete)

    Client->>API: POST /v1/calls (+ Idempotency-Key)
    API->>PG: INSERT call INITIATED + multipart_upload_id
    API-->>Client: 201 call_id + presigned part URLs

    loop Multipart parts (client → S3 only)
        Client->>S3: PUT part (presigned)
        S3-->>Client: 200
    end

    Client->>S3: CompleteMultipartUpload
    Note over Client: Client is done — no API callback required

    S3->>EB: Object / multipart complete event
    EB->>K: publish call.object.ready
    K->>V: consume call.object.ready
    V->>PG: status=UPLOAD_COMPLETE → PROCESSING
    V->>S3: HeadObject / verify size + key prefix
    alt Invalid object
        V->>PG: status=FAILED
        V->>K: DLQ / failed
    else Valid
        V->>K: publish call.validated
        K->>W: ASR → Enrich → Index
        W->>S3: get audio
        W->>M: upsert transcript + enrichment
        W->>ES: upsert SearchDocument
        W->>PG: status=INDEXED
        W->>K: processing.status
        K->>R: cache status
    end
